*Problem*

deny filter ( <https://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/commit/5f1de5bd02a5875b40d35614b57a90e522b16dc2|5f1de5b> ) is not work fine.

*Fix*

example

```
{
  "yaml-language-server": {
    "workspace_config": {
      "yaml": {
        "schemas": {
          "<https://mattn.github.io/efm-langserver/schema.json>": "config/efm-langserver/config.yaml"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

in <https://github.com/tsuyoshicho/vim-efm-langserver-settings|https://github.com/tsuyoshicho/vim-efm-langserver-settings>. work fine this PR.

* * *

*fix detail*

```
loop

lang-server : langserver-setting pickup (ex yaml-language-server and these config)
 config-name : config-data pickup (ex workspace_config and these config)
  deny-key (ex `cmd`)
   check deny target key in config-data
     remove from config-data

```

